          <![CDATA[Family weekday morning school run]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="2789" net="1">
          <![CDATA[A family weekday morning: the alarm and snooze, a calendar check for PE kit or non-uniform days, the parent making breakfast and lunchboxes while an older and a younger child wake, wash and dress in parallel sharing the bathroom, missing ties and clothes on back to front, breakfast with spills, homework and bag checks, lost shoes, walking, driving or the school bus with cancellations, late arrival at the office, forgotten lunchboxes, and the evening routine back to bed.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
